(2501, 307, '_thumbnail_id', '312'),
(2502, 307, 'post_excerpt', 'In the last 10 years the growth in technology deals has largely been driven by regulated industries whose rapid changes called for hi-tech solutions.  We expect health care and financial services tech deals to continue to grow in the near term.'),
