(2522, 325, 'post_excerpt', 'The Alvarez & Marsal Transaction Advisory Group helps clients mitigate risk and maximize value in the rapidly changing energy landscape.  We tap the resources of our seasoned industry veterans  whose experience spans across all sectors of the energy industry.'),
