(9661, 302, '_thumbnail_id', '305'),
(9662, 302, 'post_excerpt', 'Our clients recognize that the A&M Transaction Advisory Group Healthcare practice has a differentiated business model.  We have a deep understanding of the industry issues that drive financial results.  We help clients, both new and long-time healthcare investors, strategize, execute and integrate deals in the face of change and uncertainty.  '),
