(11973, 678, 'news-post-header', 'Paul Aversano is a Managing Director and National Practice Leader of Alvarez & Marsal’s Transaction Advisory Group. For more than 12 years, Mr. Aversano has specialized in leading financial accounting due diligence projects for complex public and private company transactions.'),
