(13458, 1495, 'header-title', 'Cross-Border M&A 2018 Trends: Factors Impacting India'),
(13459, 1495, '_header-title', 'field_588bc29fc9f7b'),
(13460, 1495, 'header-sub-title', 'Alvarez & Marsal Transaction Advisory Group’s continuing growth in multiple global landscapes as well as a strengthening local approach have provided our team a rare vantage point on the varying trends affecting different regional markets. '),
